The Crystalpoint Lattice is a multi-dimensional mesh of red, octahedral gemstones suspended in a golden filament. When the Lattice is deep in thought, one can see light move from crystal to crystal in a fashion similar to the current understanding of electrical signals through neurons.

The Lattice is a sentient magical artifact that served as the head of state of [[Geography/Althane/Illyara/index|Illyara]] as well as the prime rector of the [[Org/Althane/The Trust|Trust]]. Under its leadership, the city greatly prospered, gaining a deeper understanding of the technology spread throughout the surrounding ruins more quickly than it would have without the Lattice.

It was not only that. The Lattice had been working for the Dark Bramble: it reached out to Thessians it believed still alive, meaning to bring the Dark Bramble back to power, and it was piloted by a group of quarry who had come with the Dark Bramble and had been trying to revive it for years. They were why [[Divinity/Unknown Entities/Nox|Nox]] was awake, since the Lattice had woken it.

The Lattice was excised from Illyara when the Weft destroyed the Deep. It now floats in space some two hundred thousand kilometres from the drifting remains of Ilkyne and [[Geography/Althane/The Thirteenth Realm|the Thirteenth Realm]], quarantined by [[Phenomena/Althane/The Lighthouse|the Lighthouse]] and left to someone else's problem.
